  ],
  "rule": "Accepted only if, in every view, the candidate's display excess flicker is not higher than the shipped shader's by more than the tolerance, and it is no further from the supersampled reference at any guard scale by more than the tolerance; and its display excess flicker is lower by more than the tolerance in at least one view. The tolerance is the larger of the difference between two separate runs of the shipped shader and one percent of the shipped value.",
